# Spec: South Bay craft restyle

## Goal
Apply 10th Planet South Bay website craft to openthesystem.app while keeping existing palette hexes.

## Keep
- Colors: bg #0f0f0f, surface #1a1a1a, text #e8e8e8, muted #666, accent #c0392b, partner A/B
- Fonts: Barlow Condensed + IBM Plex Mono (no new font packages)
- Sharp edges, table deck list, fieldset grouping, flame/streak motifs

## Change
1. Tokens: accent-ink (dark on accent), accent-deep (hard-shadow), optional muted-soft for hierarchy
2. Primary CTAs: hard offset box-shadow (4-6px solid accent-deep), ink-on-accent, tracked uppercase
3. Accent discipline: field (primary fill), line (active/selection underlines, thin rules), text (rare punch/status)
4. Home: display hierarchy + accent punch line; mono micro labels; series headers as mono labels; sharper scroll-top
5. Ghost secondary: steel muted → text on hover (underline arrow optional)
6. Tag-pill utility for status chips if used
7. prefers-reduced-motion for any new motion
8. DESIGN.md: South Bay craft addendum

## Out of scope
- Marketing marquees / vertical wallpaper type
- New script webfont
- Cinema/dusk overlay redesign (leave unless broken by shared CSS)